Setting Default What it does Visits on Whether the trader appears at all Appears every 36000 ticks (30 min) The average wait between appearances, for the whole server. Each wait is random, so there is no schedule to learn Stays for 6000 ticks (5 min) How long it waits before wandering off Guaranteed perfect IVs 0 Rolled like any wild Ditto · 1 gives it one best stat · 6 is flawless Level 15–45 The band its level is rolled from, inclusive TM price 4–32 relic coins The coin band of the cheapest TMs, used only when <code>trader_offers.json</code> is first written <pre><code>/hms config trader enabled &lt;true|false&gt;
/hms config trader every &lt;1200-1728000&gt;
/hms config trader stay &lt;200-72000&gt;
/hms config trader ivs &lt;0-6&gt;
/hms config trader levels &lt;min&gt; &lt;max&gt;
/hms config trader coins &lt;min&gt; &lt;max&gt;
/hms config trader reload
</code></pre> <p>One appearance is one trader for the whole server, not one per player. The player it turns up near hears Ditto's cry where it stands; nothing is said in chat when it arrives or leaves. The clock runs while the server is empty and survives a restart; an appearance that lands with nobody eligible is missed rather than saved up.</p> <p>The first time it meets a player it hands them an HM Case, which has no recipe.</p>
